WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:07.305 --> 00:00:10.058
Coming here to die? What idiots.

2
00:00:10.141 --> 00:00:11.643
Fighting with you is boring.

3
00:00:11.726 --> 00:00:13.519
Come together.

4
00:00:15.188 --> 00:00:17.607
I don't even know
which is the magic beast.

5
00:00:19.984 --> 00:00:22.862
Song is as strong as a monster too.

6
00:00:28.826 --> 00:00:30.370
It's about done here.

7
00:00:30.995 --> 00:00:33.122
Sung. you've really gotten stronger.

8
00:00:33.665 --> 00:00:35.875
Where did you get that great dagger?

9
00:00:37.627 --> 00:00:39.545
Jinwoo.

10
00:00:39.629 --> 00:00:41.923
I haven't had a chance to heal you today.

11
00:00:42.006 --> 00:00:43.758
Ah... Is it?

12
00:00:43.841 --> 00:00:46.386
I hope you won't need it this time.

13
00:00:46.469 --> 00:00:48.846
No. I'm counting on you.

14
00:00:49.430 --> 00:00:50.306
Just as I thought.

15
00:00:50.390 --> 00:00:51.557
He has changed a lot.

16
00:00:52.308 --> 00:00:54.644
Not just his appearance.
but even his aura.

17
00:00:54.727 --> 00:00:56.980
I can feel his ease and confidence.

18
00:00:57.063 --> 00:00:59.357
Did you learn martial arts?

19
00:01:00.066 --> 00:01:01.943
Let's keep going.

20
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:09.074
Do you want subtitles for any video?
-=[ ai.OpenSubtitles.com ]=-

21
00:02:34.994 --> 00:02:36.079
It's a fork of the road.

22
00:02:36.788 --> 00:02:38.956
This one is even easier than expected.

23
00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:41.209
Should we split up into three groups?

24
00:02:41.292 --> 00:02:43.294
Although it will increase the risk.

25
00:02:43.377 --> 00:02:45.379
we could end the mission sooner.

26
00:02:45.463 --> 00:02:47.298
Let's do that.

27
00:02:47.381 --> 00:02:49.300
I'll take the right path
with those convicts.

28
00:02:49.801 --> 00:02:51.677
If you find the BOSS room.

29
00:02:51.761 --> 00:02:53.221
please inform me immediately.

30
00:02:54.263 --> 00:02:56.140
It must be because
my perception has improved.

31
00:02:56.224 --> 00:02:57.642
From here. I can feel

32
00:02:58.684 --> 00:03:00.269
that the boss is ahead on this path.

33
00:03:01.229 --> 00:03:03.564
I can't earn many points
from fighting goblins.

34
00:03:04.482 --> 00:03:05.566
Mr. Song.

35
00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:07.485
Let's take the left path.

36
00:03:07.568 --> 00:03:08.861
I got it.

37
00:03:08.945 --> 00:03:10.488
Then we'll take the middle one.

38
00:03:10.571 --> 00:03:11.447
Yes.

39
00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:25.086
I can handle goblins of this level.

40
00:03:25.670 --> 00:03:27.880
I hope the mission will end well.

41
00:03:28.381 --> 00:03:29.423
It should.

42
00:03:30.424 --> 00:03:34.011
They brought the weakest hunter.
so the level of this dungeon must be low.

43
00:03:34.095 --> 00:03:38.266
We thought so last time. didn't we?

44
00:03:40.852 --> 00:03:41.686
I've decided.

45
00:03:42.478 --> 00:03:43.938
Once this mission is over.

46
00:03:44.021 --> 00:03:46.232
I will go apologize to Sung.

47
00:03:46.315 --> 00:03:47.150
Eh?

48
00:03:48.025 --> 00:03:49.819
You couldn't forget it either. right?

49
00:03:50.319 --> 00:03:51.904
We ran away.

50
00:03:52.780 --> 00:03:55.116
A man who prides himself
as a hunter ran away.

51
00:03:55.867 --> 00:03:57.994
{\an8}I did it for my family.

52
00:03:58.077 --> 00:03:59.328
{\an8}but it doesn't change the fact

53
00:03:59.412 --> 00:04:01.747
{\an8}that I abandoned my companion.

54
00:04:01.831 --> 00:04:04.333
{\an8}If I want to continue
claiming to be a hunter.

55
00:04:04.417 --> 00:04:05.960
{\an8}I must learn to admit my mistakes.

56
00:04:08.004 --> 00:04:10.047
Will he forget us?

57
00:04:10.756 --> 00:04:12.175
He will never forget us.

58
00:04:12.842 --> 00:04:15.094
But I still have to apologize.

59
00:04:15.178 --> 00:04:16.470
Alright. let's go.

60
00:04:19.056 --> 00:04:20.850
Too weak.

61
00:04:20.933 --> 00:04:22.935
Goblins are no match at all.

62
00:04:23.019 --> 00:04:24.437
Finished them all?

63
00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:26.105
It's a piece of cake.

64
00:04:26.189 --> 00:04:28.524
I'm not even satisfied.

65
00:04:30.443 --> 00:04:32.737
What if they were humans?

66
00:04:32.820 --> 00:04:33.738
What?

67
00:04:33.821 --> 00:04:35.448
Can you do the same?

68
00:04:36.699 --> 00:04:38.910
Humans aren't that different
from these magic beasts.

69
00:04:38.993 --> 00:04:41.204
Yeah. they're all the same.

70
00:04:42.538 --> 00:04:43.998
What do you want from me?

71
00:04:45.458 --> 00:04:49.170
Three men violated my daughter.

72
00:04:49.253 --> 00:04:51.422
She hanged herself.

73
00:04:51.505 --> 00:04:53.841
My wife ended up in a mental
hospital due to the trauma.

74
00:04:53.925 --> 00:04:55.676
But those three guys

75
00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:59.347
will be released in a few years
as if nothing had happened.

76
00:04:59.430 --> 00:05:00.890
And they...

77
00:05:00.973 --> 00:05:02.934
They still have their hunter licenses.

78
00:05:03.017 --> 00:05:05.394
I've heard that
hunters can get sentence reductions

79
00:05:05.478 --> 00:05:07.563
by participating in raid missions.

80
00:05:08.564 --> 00:05:10.483
It's not fair at all.

81
00:05:10.566 --> 00:05:13.361
My daughter will never return to me.

82
00:05:16.405 --> 00:05:17.323
What is that?

83
00:05:17.406 --> 00:05:19.825
Here's three billion.

84
00:05:19.909 --> 00:05:22.912
Please

85
00:05:23.663 --> 00:05:25.289
Kill them for me.

86
00:05:26.415 --> 00:05:31.212
No outsider would know what
happened in the dungeon. right?

87
00:05:31.295 --> 00:05:32.338
I beg you.

88
00:05:32.421 --> 00:05:34.507
Please help me.

89
00:05:37.343 --> 00:05:40.763
After leaving here. I'll report to
the Surveillance Department

90
00:05:41.347 --> 00:05:43.307
that the three of you

91
00:05:43.391 --> 00:05:46.227
encountered a hundred goblins here.

92
00:05:47.895 --> 00:05:50.147
This path is really winding.

93
00:05:50.231 --> 00:05:52.024
Are we really going forward?

94
00:05:52.108 --> 00:05:54.276
Did we choose the wrong path?

95
00:05:54.360 --> 00:05:55.945
Phew.

96
00:05:58.489 --> 00:06:00.116
Help...

97
00:06:00.199 --> 00:06:02.451
{\an8}Don't expect a quick death.

98
00:06:02.994 --> 00:06:06.038
{\an8}I'll torture you as much as possible
before ending your lives.

99
00:06:06.122 --> 00:06:07.623
{\an8}That's what I was told to do.

100
00:06:07.707 --> 00:06:09.834
What... what are you doing?

101
00:06:10.710 --> 00:06:11.919
Ah.

102
00:06:12.003 --> 00:06:13.504
The paths are connected?

103
00:06:14.088 --> 00:06:14.964
In other words.

104
00:06:15.047 --> 00:06:18.426
the left path leads to the BOSS room.

105
00:06:18.509 --> 00:06:19.677
That saves me the time for finding it.

106
00:06:19.760 --> 00:06:21.595
Help me...

107
00:06:22.763 --> 00:06:24.724
Although this went
differently than planned...

108
00:06:30.479 --> 00:06:32.606
That Kang Taeshik.

109
00:06:32.690 --> 00:06:34.859
He and his superior from the Surveillance
Department visited me at the hospital.

110
00:06:35.985 --> 00:06:38.446
I hope he doesn't remember me.

111
00:06:40.156 --> 00:06:41.449
Mr. Song.

112
00:06:41.532 --> 00:06:42.867
Okay.

113
00:06:48.122 --> 00:06:49.623
What happened?

114
00:06:52.126 --> 00:06:53.419
Jungho.

115
00:06:56.130 --> 00:06:57.256
Mr. Kang.

116
00:07:10.561 --> 00:07:12.980
Mr. Kim.

117
00:07:13.856 --> 00:07:15.733
Joohee... treat them.

118
00:07:16.359 --> 00:07:18.152
Go treat them!

119
00:07:18.235 --> 00:07:19.403
Yes!

120
00:07:22.615 --> 00:07:24.825
Mr. Kim. pull yourself together.

121
00:07:25.409 --> 00:07:28.037
These wounds were not
caused by magic beasts.

122
00:07:28.746 --> 00:07:29.955
They are caused by sharp blades.

123
00:07:30.039 --> 00:07:30.873
Moreover.

124
00:07:30.956 --> 00:07:33.626
the enemy avoided lethal injuries
to create more wounds.

125
00:07:33.709 --> 00:07:35.920
It's no use.

126
00:07:36.587 --> 00:07:38.589
I can't survive.

127
00:07:38.672 --> 00:07:40.257
What nonsense is that?

128
00:07:40.966 --> 00:07:42.635
You need to be alive.

129
00:07:42.718 --> 00:07:44.136
Don't you have a family?

130
00:07:44.970 --> 00:07:46.430
You must...

131
00:07:46.514 --> 00:07:49.934
You must live no matter what!

132
00:07:50.017 --> 00:07:51.894
Only then can I hate you.

133
00:07:52.770 --> 00:07:54.188
I'm sorry.

134
00:07:54.271 --> 00:07:56.357
I am truly sorry.

135
00:07:56.440 --> 00:08:00.694
I didn't want to apologize like this.

136
00:08:01.404 --> 00:08:05.032
I want to bow my head
and apologize to you.

137
00:08:05.866 --> 00:08:06.951
Sung.

138
00:08:07.618 --> 00:08:08.994
I am really sorry.

139
00:08:09.870 --> 00:08:12.164
Believe me.

140
00:08:20.673 --> 00:08:21.841
Kim.

141
00:08:31.016 --> 00:08:32.560
Wow.

142
00:08:32.643 --> 00:08:33.978
You're quite agile.

143
00:08:35.604 --> 00:08:38.816
I wanted to take care of the healer first.

144
00:08:40.234 --> 00:08:43.112
{\an8}I didn't expect that move to be blocked.

145
00:08:43.195 --> 00:08:44.363
Mr. Kang.

146
00:08:44.447 --> 00:08:45.948
Did you do this?

147
00:08:46.031 --> 00:08:47.241
What if I did?

148
00:08:47.324 --> 00:08:50.619
{\an8}Aren't you from the Hunter's Association?

149
00:08:50.703 --> 00:08:51.829
{\an8}How could you do this?

150
00:08:51.912 --> 00:08:53.831
{\an8}I've thought of a good story.

151
00:08:54.915 --> 00:08:58.836
I was going to claim that
you were killed by goblins.

152
00:08:58.919 --> 00:09:00.421
But I want to make a change.

153
00:09:01.380 --> 00:09:03.591
These criminals attempted to escape.

154
00:09:03.674 --> 00:09:05.634
They killed you first.

155
00:09:05.718 --> 00:09:09.972
and ambushed me from behind
when I fought the Boss.

156
00:09:10.473 --> 00:09:13.142
However. with their strength.
they couldn't harm me.

157
00:09:13.225 --> 00:09:15.603
In the end. only I survived.

158
00:09:15.686 --> 00:09:17.938
Perfect. isn't it?

159
00:09:18.022 --> 00:09:19.315
You scum.

160
00:09:19.857 --> 00:09:21.942
You can't defeat him.

161
00:09:22.026 --> 00:09:23.235
Let me do it.

162
00:09:24.487 --> 00:09:26.280
Kim. lend me your sword.

163
00:09:27.281 --> 00:09:29.658
It's been a long time since
I've crossed swords with someone.

164
00:09:30.242 --> 00:09:32.244
He is B-rank. higher than me.

165
00:09:32.328 --> 00:09:33.704
But...

166
00:09:33.787 --> 00:09:37.082
Joohee. can you cast a physical
enhancement spell on me?

167
00:09:37.166 --> 00:09:38.459
Yes.

168
00:09:38.542 --> 00:09:41.879
Assassins usually have low defense.
and that's their weakness.

169
00:09:42.379 --> 00:09:43.964
I must target that.

170
00:09:44.548 --> 00:09:47.676
Even if an old Mage had
his strength enhanced.

171
00:09:47.760 --> 00:09:49.220
it would only backfire.

172
00:09:49.803 --> 00:09:52.014
Right now. I am a swordsman.

173
00:09:54.350 --> 00:09:55.851
You are a Mage.

174
00:09:56.435 --> 00:09:58.812
{\an8}What's the point of picking up a sword?

175
00:10:02.024 --> 00:10:03.817
{\an8}There might be a point.

176
00:10:04.401 --> 00:10:05.945
You have good skills.

177
00:10:06.529 --> 00:10:08.155
Although enhanced.

178
00:10:08.656 --> 00:10:10.574
your movements are
very skilled in themselves.

179
00:10:10.658 --> 00:10:13.369
Although just for a moment.
Mr. Song caught up to his speed.

180
00:10:14.495 --> 00:10:16.038
If he could be a bit faster...

181
00:10:16.121 --> 00:10:17.540
Your attack is fast and accurate.

182
00:10:18.123 --> 00:10:20.501
You have the ability to attack
with a sword instead of magic.

183
00:10:21.919 --> 00:10:23.963
But that's all there is to it.

184
00:10:28.217 --> 00:10:30.511
That healer is annoying.

185
00:10:30.594 --> 00:10:32.012
{\an8}I should get rid of you first.

186
00:10:36.767 --> 00:10:39.353
Turning your back on a swordsman?

187
00:10:39.436 --> 00:10:42.439
Seems like you're no ordinary old man.

188
00:10:42.523 --> 00:10:45.776
After all. I am the master
of an S-rank hunter.

189
00:10:45.859 --> 00:10:47.945
In terms of swordsmanship.
I won't lose to you.

190
00:10:48.028 --> 00:10:49.488
That being said.

191
00:10:49.572 --> 00:10:51.907
the power you've been granted
is ultimately limited.

192
00:10:52.408 --> 00:10:53.993
A Mage

193
00:10:54.076 --> 00:10:57.621
can never keep up with an Assassin.

194
00:11:02.376 --> 00:11:03.711
Mr. Song.

195
00:11:05.921 --> 00:11:06.755
No.

196
00:11:06.839 --> 00:11:09.717
The healer has exhausted her power.

197
00:11:14.221 --> 00:11:15.639
It's over.

198
00:11:22.855 --> 00:11:23.689
Did it work?

199
00:11:24.189 --> 00:11:28.569
You posed as a swordsman
to lower my guard against the magic.

200
00:11:28.652 --> 00:11:31.363
You unleashed a magical attack
at the moment I made my final strike.

201
00:11:32.364 --> 00:11:34.116
This tactic isn't bad.

202
00:11:34.199 --> 00:11:36.076
{\an8}You cunning old fox.

203
00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:37.745
Is it over?

204
00:11:38.704 --> 00:11:39.788
Die.

205
00:11:45.794 --> 00:11:47.629
You again.

206
00:11:47.713 --> 00:11:48.797
Who are you?

207
00:11:49.965 --> 00:11:51.258
I'm Sung Jinwoo.

208
00:11:52.134 --> 00:11:53.135
{\an8}an E-Rank hunter.

209
00:11:54.470 --> 00:11:55.679
E-rank?

210
00:11:56.472 --> 00:11:57.806
How is that possible?

211
00:11:58.390 --> 00:11:59.975
Sung.

212
00:12:00.059 --> 00:12:01.018
What was that just now?

213
00:12:01.101 --> 00:12:03.437
If you are a power-type E-rank hunter.

214
00:12:03.520 --> 00:12:06.023
that strength would make sense.

215
00:12:06.106 --> 00:12:09.985
But you reacted fast enough
to block my attacks twice.

216
00:12:10.069 --> 00:12:11.612
Are you an Assassin?

217
00:12:11.695 --> 00:12:13.405
Never mind. It doesn't matter.

218
00:12:13.989 --> 00:12:15.699
You've been hiding your true power. right?

219
00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:18.619
You seem to know each other.

220
00:12:18.702 --> 00:12:20.496
Then you can't be a False Ranker.

221
00:12:20.579 --> 00:12:22.956
After all. you wouldn't
leave any witnesses alive.

222
00:12:23.540 --> 00:12:24.583
In that case.

223
00:12:24.666 --> 00:12:26.210
there's only one answer.

224
00:12:27.211 --> 00:12:28.128
{\an8}You're a second awakener.

225
00:12:28.212 --> 00:12:29.380
{\an8}Sung is...

226
00:12:29.463 --> 00:12:31.256
{\an8}A second awakener.

227
00:12:31.340 --> 00:12:32.591
If that's the case.

228
00:12:32.674 --> 00:12:34.676
did it happen after
the double dungeon incident?

229
00:12:35.260 --> 00:12:36.595
Double dungeon?

230
00:12:36.678 --> 00:12:38.097
Is he

231
00:12:38.180 --> 00:12:40.182
that lousy E-rank hunter?

232
00:12:40.766 --> 00:12:43.852
His appearance and impression
are completely different.

233
00:12:43.936 --> 00:12:46.563
And his measured value was only 10.

234
00:12:47.231 --> 00:12:49.149
Did the second awakening
happen after that?

235
00:12:49.233 --> 00:12:50.150
If so.

236
00:12:50.234 --> 00:12:52.528
how did he survive the double dungeon?

237
00:12:53.112 --> 00:12:54.738
Well. regardless.

238
00:12:54.822 --> 00:12:57.324
it seems you have little
experience as a hunter.

239
00:12:57.825 --> 00:13:00.953
Let me teach you a thing or two.

240
00:13:01.036 --> 00:13:02.538
Why do you do this?

241
00:13:03.122 --> 00:13:04.623
You mean these prisoners?

242
00:13:05.374 --> 00:13:08.127
I was entrusted
by the family of the victim.

243
00:13:08.669 --> 00:13:12.172
They killed someone without any remorse.

244
00:13:12.256 --> 00:13:14.007
I'm doing justice.

245
00:13:14.091 --> 00:13:16.760
No. I mean Mr. Kim and Mr. Kang.

246
00:13:17.344 --> 00:13:18.470
Why did you kill them?

247
00:13:19.179 --> 00:13:20.931
Was it to silence them?

248
00:13:21.014 --> 00:13:22.516
Then you could have made it quick.

249
00:13:23.267 --> 00:13:25.644
Yet you avoided inflicting fatal wounds.

250
00:13:25.727 --> 00:13:27.271
as if to torture them.

251
00:13:28.355 --> 00:13:29.773
It's for the victim?

252
00:13:29.857 --> 00:13:31.066
Cut it out.

253
00:13:31.150 --> 00:13:32.943
That is not your true nature.

254
00:13:35.737 --> 00:13:36.780
Yes.

255
00:13:36.864 --> 00:13:38.866
These things are trivial for me.

256
00:13:39.408 --> 00:13:41.410
But you seem to have misunderstood.

257
00:13:41.952 --> 00:13:46.331
I am a B-rank hunter that
many large guilds fight for.

258
00:13:47.249 --> 00:13:49.960
Why do you think
I joined Hunter's Association

259
00:13:50.043 --> 00:13:51.795
that pays a meager salary?

260
00:13:51.879 --> 00:13:53.547
{\an8}Because

261
00:13:53.630 --> 00:13:55.090
{\an8}compared to killing magic beasts.

262
00:13:55.174 --> 00:13:58.218
{\an8}I enjoy killing people more.

263
00:14:01.972 --> 00:14:04.600
Even with a second awakening.
an E-rank hunter can't be very strong.

264
00:14:06.810 --> 00:14:07.978
You're too slow.

265
00:14:08.061 --> 00:14:09.188
You're quite fast.

266
00:14:12.608 --> 00:14:14.651
How can he have such skills?

267
00:14:14.735 --> 00:14:18.489
He's no longer the Sung I knew.

268
00:14:21.200 --> 00:14:23.243
Our speeds are comparable.

269
00:14:23.327 --> 00:14:24.995
Even if we have the same skills

270
00:14:25.078 --> 00:14:26.789
and the same strength.

271
00:14:26.872 --> 00:14:28.957
your experience
against high-level opponents

272
00:14:29.041 --> 00:14:30.125
is far too little compared to mine.

273
00:14:30.209 --> 00:14:33.378
These differences will
lead to your defeat.

274
00:14:41.178 --> 00:14:42.930
You are a tough one.

275
00:14:43.013 --> 00:14:44.723
-Excuse me.
-What?

276
00:14:44.807 --> 00:14:47.726
Could you please tone
down your killing intent?

277
00:14:48.769 --> 00:14:50.062
Look.

278
00:14:50.145 --> 00:14:51.897
The system has responded to you.

279
00:14:53.440 --> 00:14:55.442
Now I have to thank this system.

280
00:14:56.026 --> 00:14:59.446
It has given me another reason
why I must kill you.

281
00:14:59.530 --> 00:15:01.240
{\an8}System?

282
00:15:01.323 --> 00:15:02.533
{\an8}What's up with him?

283
00:15:03.116 --> 00:15:05.494
I'm the one with the upper hand.

284
00:15:12.292 --> 00:15:13.544
He got even faster.

285
00:15:14.503 --> 00:15:15.504
It's poison.

286
00:15:15.587 --> 00:15:16.964
Is this a special effect of your dagger?

287
00:15:22.177 --> 00:15:24.847
Then let me show you
something interesting too.

288
00:15:26.849 --> 00:15:27.891
He disappeared.

289
00:15:28.433 --> 00:15:30.561
I had completely concealed my presence.

290
00:15:30.644 --> 00:15:32.271
Your senses are sharp.

291
00:15:32.354 --> 00:15:33.939
Skill Invisibility.

292
00:15:34.523 --> 00:15:37.442
It hides one's shape. sound.
scent. among others.

293
00:15:37.526 --> 00:15:41.613
Even among Assassins.
only a very few can acquire this skill.

294
00:15:41.697 --> 00:15:44.741
Of course. those who know
that I can use this skill

295
00:15:44.825 --> 00:15:46.368
are nonexistent.

296
00:15:46.451 --> 00:15:47.828
After all.

297
00:15:49.830 --> 00:15:51.790
there hasn't been one

298
00:15:51.874 --> 00:15:54.585
who has seen me use this skill
and lived to tell about it.

299
00:15:55.419 --> 00:15:57.087
I have sealed your speed.

300
00:15:57.880 --> 00:15:59.506
-Jinwoo.
-Stay put.

301
00:16:00.757 --> 00:16:02.926
After I kill him. it's your turn.

302
00:16:03.510 --> 00:16:05.929
If this goes on. Sung...

303
00:16:06.013 --> 00:16:10.309
With your foot injured.
can you still dodge my attacks?

304
00:16:10.392 --> 00:16:11.518
Hey.

305
00:16:11.602 --> 00:16:13.103
Have you said enough?

306
00:16:13.854 --> 00:16:14.771
Full Recovery.

307
00:16:17.107 --> 00:16:18.859
He recovered instantly.

308
00:16:18.942 --> 00:16:21.862
A Fighter capable of using healing magic.

309
00:16:21.945 --> 00:16:23.697
I've never heard of such a thing.

310
00:16:23.780 --> 00:16:25.407
How many times can he use it?

311
00:16:25.490 --> 00:16:26.909
I cannot predict it at all.

312
00:16:26.992 --> 00:16:28.994
He's a dangerous one.

313
00:16:29.077 --> 00:16:30.954
I've lost another emotion.

314
00:16:31.955 --> 00:16:33.707
With scum like you.

315
00:16:33.790 --> 00:16:35.709
is it a waste of time to get angry?

316
00:16:37.252 --> 00:16:38.170
I see.

317
00:16:38.837 --> 00:16:40.881
You've done it. right?

318
00:16:42.716 --> 00:16:44.968
You're like me after all.

319
00:16:45.552 --> 00:16:46.803
I see.

320
00:16:46.887 --> 00:16:48.764
He probably had to make

321
00:16:48.847 --> 00:16:51.475
many difficult choices in a short time.

322
00:16:52.059 --> 00:16:54.686
It isn't just his appearance that changed.

323
00:16:54.770 --> 00:16:56.146
Awakening.

324
00:16:56.229 --> 00:16:59.441
This power beyond common sense
has changed the rules of the world.

325
00:17:00.150 --> 00:17:02.653
This is a lawless land
belonging only to hunters.

326
00:17:02.736 --> 00:17:04.446
There is no law here.

327
00:17:04.529 --> 00:17:06.865
only the winner.

328
00:17:12.871 --> 00:17:13.705
Can he be

329
00:17:13.789 --> 00:17:16.249
gauging my position
through my killing intent?

330
00:17:17.042 --> 00:17:19.836
But even so. he still can't
pinpoint my exact location.

331
00:17:24.591 --> 00:17:26.259
What... what's wrong?

332
00:17:28.095 --> 00:17:29.513
Wait.

333
00:17:29.596 --> 00:17:30.931
No way.

334
00:17:34.142 --> 00:17:37.437
How... is it possible?

335
00:17:43.610 --> 00:17:46.530
You asked me why I killed. right?

336
00:17:47.447 --> 00:17:49.825
It's pointless to apply
ordinary people's views

337
00:17:50.367 --> 00:17:53.662
to hunters who frequently
consort with death.

338
00:17:54.329 --> 00:17:55.914
You're the same.

339
00:17:56.498 --> 00:18:00.335
We've both become killing machines.

340
00:18:00.961 --> 00:18:02.004
{\an8}So.

341
00:18:02.087 --> 00:18:03.922
{\an8}I lost and will die.

342
00:18:04.006 --> 00:18:06.425
{\an8}It's the logical rule.

343
00:18:07.342 --> 00:18:09.052
Who are you?

344
00:18:09.636 --> 00:18:10.971
Being an Assassin.

345
00:18:11.054 --> 00:18:13.056
you are capable of using healing magic
and debuff magic.

346
00:18:13.140 --> 00:18:14.391
I've never heard of that.

347
00:18:14.975 --> 00:18:16.101
Well.

348
00:18:16.184 --> 00:18:18.687
I would like to know too.

349
00:18:23.191 --> 00:18:25.235
Since you've killed me.

350
00:18:25.318 --> 00:18:29.072
you can no longer hide your identity.

351
00:18:29.156 --> 00:18:33.243
What if I were the kind of hunter
who grows constantly in battle?

352
00:18:36.246 --> 00:18:38.040
Your shadow

353
00:18:38.665 --> 00:18:40.667
is already connected to the darkness.

354
00:18:41.501 --> 00:18:45.630
Your power will become
as unfathomable as it.

355
00:18:45.714 --> 00:18:48.216
However. you must be careful.

356
00:18:49.051 --> 00:18:51.553
When you stare into the abyss.

357
00:18:52.137 --> 00:18:56.933
the abyss stares back at you.

358
00:19:02.939 --> 00:19:04.024
Indeed.

359
00:19:04.107 --> 00:19:06.860
My strength has grown rapidly.

360
00:19:07.611 --> 00:19:09.071
But I feel

361
00:19:09.905 --> 00:19:11.448
that as my strength grows.

362
00:19:11.531 --> 00:19:15.202
a part of me is gradually falling apart.

363
00:19:15.285 --> 00:19:16.411
Jinwoo.

364
00:19:16.995 --> 00:19:18.705
Thank you.

365
00:19:18.789 --> 00:19:20.415
You saved us.

366
00:19:20.499 --> 00:19:23.085
Without you. we would have died.

367
00:19:23.168 --> 00:19:24.086
It's nothing.

368
00:19:24.628 --> 00:19:26.338
Please go ahead and leave.

369
00:19:27.339 --> 00:19:28.673
I need to close up the dungeon.

370
00:19:28.757 --> 00:19:29.591
What?

371
00:19:29.674 --> 00:19:31.051
You're going alone?

372
00:19:31.802 --> 00:19:34.012
No. we'll do as you say.

373
00:19:34.554 --> 00:19:38.058
It's a pity that we can't
bury Kim and Kang.

374
00:19:38.141 --> 00:19:39.559
I'll wait for you outside.

375
00:19:51.571 --> 00:19:52.489
Chief Woo.

376
00:19:53.073 --> 00:19:54.074
I've heard the report.

377
00:19:54.157 --> 00:19:55.033
Where are the survivors?

378
00:19:55.117 --> 00:19:56.201
Over there.

379
00:19:56.785 --> 00:19:57.702
{\an8}Speaking of which.

380
00:19:57.786 --> 00:20:01.498
{\an8}I didn't expect Kang Taeshik
to be involved in murders.

381
00:20:02.499 --> 00:20:04.709
although I did suspect him.

382
00:20:04.793 --> 00:20:07.712
As his superior. I was too careless.

383
00:20:08.713 --> 00:20:09.965
It's these three.

384
00:20:12.008 --> 00:20:13.343
I remember

385
00:20:13.426 --> 00:20:15.137
he was that E-rank hunter back then.

386
00:20:15.804 --> 00:20:17.180
He looks like a different person.

387
00:20:18.306 --> 00:20:19.683
Long time no see.

388
00:20:19.766 --> 00:20:21.560
Um. you're from
the Surveillance Department.

389
00:20:21.643 --> 00:20:22.894
Woo Jinchul.

390
00:20:22.978 --> 00:20:26.231
This time my subordinate
has caused huge trouble.

391
00:20:27.065 --> 00:20:28.441
But first.

392
00:20:28.525 --> 00:20:30.777
let me get straight to the point.

393
00:20:31.361 --> 00:20:33.029
Which of you

394
00:20:33.113 --> 00:20:34.239
killed Kang Taeshik?

395
00:20:34.823 --> 00:20:37.325
It seems I can no longer hide.

396
00:20:37.993 --> 00:20:39.161
It's a pity.

397
00:20:39.244 --> 00:20:42.247
My collaboration with Jinho
might have to come to an end.

398
00:20:43.123 --> 00:20:44.833
It was me.

399
00:20:44.916 --> 00:20:47.627
I killed Mr. Kang.

400
00:20:47.711 --> 00:20:49.796
Excuse me. I remember your rank is...

401
00:20:49.880 --> 00:20:51.464
I'm a C-rank hunter.

402
00:20:51.548 --> 00:20:54.426
How could a C-rank hunter
manage to kill a B-rank hunter?

403
00:20:55.010 --> 00:20:56.678
Because we have her.

404
00:20:58.471 --> 00:20:59.764
I see.

405
00:20:59.848 --> 00:21:02.350
So you managed to defeat him
with the healer's assistance.

406
00:21:03.643 --> 00:21:06.104
Kang Taeshik was among
the top of the B-rank hunters.

407
00:21:06.188 --> 00:21:08.064
I don't think
a C-rank Mage could kill him.

408
00:21:08.148 --> 00:21:09.566
no matter how hard he tried.

409
00:21:11.151 --> 00:21:12.402
I understand.

410
00:21:12.485 --> 00:21:15.405
We need to complete the report.

411
00:21:15.488 --> 00:21:16.865
Please come with me.

412
00:21:17.532 --> 00:21:20.702
{\an8}Now is not the time to be smug
about having killed Kang Taeshik.

413
00:21:21.286 --> 00:21:23.163
I couldn't see it at that time.

414
00:21:23.246 --> 00:21:25.040
This person is an A-rank hunter.

415
00:21:25.123 --> 00:21:27.209
He's not someone I can handle right now.

416
00:21:28.668 --> 00:21:31.630
Was I meddling too much?

417
00:21:32.339 --> 00:21:36.092
You must have your reasons
for hiding your strength.

418
00:21:37.886 --> 00:21:41.556
Alright. Consider it my way of
repaying you for saving my life.

419
00:21:46.186 --> 00:21:47.479
Three hours later.

420
00:21:47.562 --> 00:21:51.274
the man who commissioned Kang Taeshik
to kill the prisoners turned himself in.

421
00:21:51.358 --> 00:21:54.069
The whole case was concluded
as legitimate self-defense.

422
00:21:56.363 --> 00:21:57.739
That was exhausting.

423
00:21:58.782 --> 00:21:59.699
Jinwoo.

424
00:22:01.326 --> 00:22:02.160
Do you

425
00:22:03.578 --> 00:22:05.038
remember this?

425
00:22:06.305 --> 00:23:06.528
Do you want subtitles for any video?
